### =============================================================================
### Auth & users — REST Client
### Фаза 4: Cookie + Bearer (authenticate) + authorize(CAN_*)
### Login → Set-Cookie: token=… + JSON.token
### GET /api/logs: admin 200, student 403
### GET /api/users (список): student 403, lab_admin/system_admin 200
### =============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

### Демо (сидер seed-role-demo-users), пароль Password123!
@demoPassword = Password123!
@adminEmail = system.admin@lab.local
@labAdminEmail = lab.admin@lab.local
@researcherEmail = researcher@lab.local
@studentEmail = student@lab.local

### После логина:
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}
@studentToken = {{loginStudent.response.body.token}}

### =============================================================================
### 1. РЕГИСТРАЦИЯ (публично, без Bearer)
### Сервер всегда ставит role=student, даже если в body указан system_admin
### =============================================================================

# @name registerStudent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Rest Client Student",
  "email": "rest.student@lab.local",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

# Попытка «украсть» роль — в ответе всё равно student
# @name registerWithFakeRole
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Fake Admin",
  "email": "fake.admin@lab.local",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "system_admin"
}

### =============================================================================
### 2. АУТЕНТИФИКАЦИЯ (login) — получение JWT
### Ответ: { message, token, user }  — user должен содержать role из БД
### =============================================================================

### Ответ login (фаза 3):
### {
###   "token": "<jwt>",
###   "user": { "id", "email", "role", "roleLabel", "laboratory_id", "employee_id", "employee": {...} }
### }
### JWT payload (jwt.io): id, email, role, laboratory_id, employee_id
### system_admin → laboratory_id: null | lab_admin/researcher → число lab

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{demoPassword}}"
}

###

# @name loginLabAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{labAdminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{demoPassword}}"
}

###

# @name loginResearcher
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{researcherEmail}}",
  "password": "{{demoPassword}}"
}

###

# @name loginStudent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{studentEmail}}",
  "password": "{{demoPassword}}"
}

###

# Неверный пароль → 401
# @name loginFail
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{studentEmail}}",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### =============================================================================
### 3. ПРОФИЛЬ (нужен Bearer) — «я вошёл?»
### Подставь @token вручную, если {{login.response.body.token}} не подхватился
### =============================================================================

# @name profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# Без токена → 401
# @name profileNoAuth
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/profile

###

# @name updateProfile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "System Admin (updated)"
}

### =============================================================================
### 4. ПОЛЬЗОВАТЕЛИ (CRUD) — сейчас защищены только JWT, не ролью
### После фазы 4: без CAN_MANAGE_USERS → 403
### =============================================================================

# @name listUsers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# @name getUserById
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# Обновление чужого пользователя (role менять смогут только админы — фаза 6)
# @name updateUser
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Updated via REST"
}

### =============================================================================
### 5. АВТОРИЗАЦИЯ ПО РОЛИ (фаза 4)
### system_admin → 200 на /api/logs и GET /api/users
### student → 403 на оба
### =============================================================================

# Сначала выполни # @name login (admin) — токен в @token
# @name logsAsAdmin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/logs?limit=5&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# @name listUsersAsAdmin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# Сначала выполни # @name loginStudent
# @name logsAsStudent
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/logs?limit=5&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

###

# @name listUsersAsStudent
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

###

# Только cookie (без Bearer) — после login, если REST Client сохранил Set-Cookie
# @name profileByCookieOnly
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/profile
Cookie: token={{token}}

### =============================================================================
### 6. LOGOUT (чистит cookie token)
### =============================================================================

# @name logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =============================================================================
### Где хранится информация
###
### Пользователи: MySQL `users` (role, employee_id → lab)
### Права: server/config/roles.js (CAN_*)
### Auth: server/middleware/authMiddleware.js — Cookie || Bearer + authorize
### =============================================================================
